<H1 ALIGN=CENTER> Potion List (by Dryad)    </H1>
<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>

<pre>

Here's my combo list for alchemist potions.  Every alchemist has a
unique list of components for potions, so use this as an example only.  
There are a total of 197 potions; each alchemist can produce the same
set of 197 potions through a different combination of components.



Potion name                      Metal          Organ       Plant
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
acid_arrow                       pyrite         lung        boneset
acid_wind                        mithril        stomach     sweet_flag
all-seeing_eye                   adamantium     foot        mugwort
anti_magic_field                 potassium      bladder     mistletoe
appraise                         starmetal      paw         cabbage
aura_detection                   gold           leg         onion
aura_of_hate                     gold           beak        cotton
banish                           uranium        gill        water_lily
baptize                          lead           leg         mushroom
bash                             gold           arm         mugwort
battlecry                        pyrite         bladder     wormwood
blacksmithing                    copper         snout       mugwort
blast_lightning                  iridium        eye         mugwort
bless                            indium         bladder     mugwort
bless_armament                   mithril        antenna     thistle
blessing_of_tarmalen             tin            liver       boneset
blurred_image                    titanium       stomach     water_lily
burial_ceremony                  brass          ear         mugwort
call_pigeon                      silver         lung        cotton
camouflage                       darksteel      beak        holly
camping                          potassium      beak        barberry
cardiac_stimulation              indium         horn        soapwort
cash_flow                        platinum       paw         cauliflower
ceremony                         platinum       heart       burdock
chaos_bolt                       tin            ear         bloodroot
chill_touch                      zhentorium     liver       mistletoe
clairvoyance                     hematite       arm         onion
cold_tolerance                   nullium        gill        tomato
compare                          gold           arm         lobelia
consider                         dukonium       leg         tomato
corrosion_shield                 starmetal      tendril     thistle
create_air_armour                indium         eye         borage
create_food                      dukonium       antenna     sweet_flag
credit_check                     mithril        spleen      onion
cure_critical_wounds             illumium       tendril     holly
cure_player                      illumium       nose        tomato
curse_of_tarmalen                chromium       leg         holly
damn_armament                    darksteel      tendril     burdock
dark_baptism                     nullium        foot        soapwort
darkfire                         palladium      tendril     burdock
darkness                         electrum       paw         cotton
deaths_door                      zhentorium     arm         mystic_carrot
desecrate_ground                 potassium      bladder     lobelia
destructive_rage                 cobalt         eye         bloodroot
detect_alignment                 chromium       spleen      mandrake
detect_poison                    titanium       tail        cotton
detect_race                      duraluminium   lung        jaslah
dimension_door                   bronze         kidney      tomato
dispel_magical_protection        kryptonite     bladder     vine
displacement                     highsteel      tail        mugwort
disruption                       potassium      ear         cauliflower
drying_wind                      graphite       liver       jimsonweed
earth_skin                       batium         eye         vine
energy_channeling                tin            tendril     wormwood
ether_boundary                   bronze         tendril     cotton
exchange_money                   tormium        nose        water_lily
feather_weight                   illumium       eye         water_lily
field_of_fear                    darksteel      wing        wormwood
field_of_light                   cesium         nose        cotton
fire_blast                       hematite       kidney      mugwort
fire_building                    electrum       stomach     bloodroot
fire_walking                     nullium        foot        wolfbane
firebolt                         mithril        arm         wormwood
first_aid                        gold           nose        mandrake
